# Copy to .env, then `set -a; source .env; set +a` before a personal build.
#
# This exact string is the personal-use acknowledgment required by design
# section 2.1. It is not a secret, but .env stays untracked so a personal
# artifact cannot be produced accidentally. See DEVELOPING.md.
export AUTOSPEED_PERSONAL_USE_ACK='Do not configure or interact with Autospeed while driving. Obey applicable laws and remain attentive.'
